+# Assign a REVIEW claim's review to the body's user (trimmed), replacing any earlier one, and write REVIEW_ASSIGNED.
+# A blank user, a claim in any other status, or a user who is not a steward (by role or delegation) is refused (400)
+# and writes nothing.
